classDiagram
  class TreeType {
    -string name
    -string color
    -string texture
    +draw(x, y) string
  }
  class TreeTypeFactory {
    -Map~string, TreeType~ cache$
    +getTreeType(name, color, texture)$ TreeType
    +count()$ number
  }
  class Tree {
    -number x
    -number y
    -TreeType type
    +draw() string
  }
  class Forest {
    -Tree[] trees
    +plantTree(x, y, name, color, texture) void
    +draw() void
  }
  Forest o--> "*" Tree
  Tree --> TreeType : compartilha
  TreeTypeFactory ..> TreeType : cria e reutiliza
  Forest ..> TreeTypeFactory
  note for TreeType "FLYWEIGHT: estado intrínseco<br/>(compartilhado e imutável)"
  note for Tree "CONTEXTO: estado extrínseco<br/>(posição, único por árvore)"
